<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel indicated firmer in pre-open.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel indicated firmer in pre-open.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc were indicated firmer on Tuesday in grey market trading ahead of the 0800 GMT market open, traders said.</p>
<p>One operator said the stock should open around 0.50 francs firmer on a bear squeeze, up from the 9.15 francs at which was it was suspended on September 30.</p>
</text>
